    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sci-fi otome AVG game where players will uncover the truth of the events by solving puzzles and making choices that trigger different endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the year 2380, after humanity experienced the rebellion of the super AI Phoenix, civilization regressed by nearly a century. The use of mechanical intelligence was globally banned. Humanity turned its hopes for the future towards life sciences that could modify their own genes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two years later, without your knowledge, you were chosen by the AI Phoenix as a &quot;Spark.&quot; During your involvement in a military operation in Kanteya City, you clashed with a red-haired interstellar pirate leader and a mysterious black-haired man. Your frequent activities exposed you to the undercurrents, and multiple factions, engaged in overt and covert struggles, reached out to you. Some wanted to extinguish you, others sought to claim you for themselves, and some even hailed you as the dawn of a new world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With your mother's mysterious death, your father's demise in the stars, and your friends being innocently affected, who should you align with next, and where should you head?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550670/extras/7a370dbb6e28a2dbf224516c6cbf7adf.avif?t=1741662122\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sci-fi otome AVG game where players will uncover the truth of the events by solving puzzles and making choices that trigger different endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the year 2380, after humanity experienced the rebellion of the super AI Phoenix, civilization regressed by nearly a century. The use of mechanical intelligence was globally banned. Humanity turned its hopes for the future towards life sciences that could modify their own genes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two years later, without your knowledge, you were chosen by the AI Phoenix as a &quot;Spark.&quot; During your involvement in a military operation in Kanteya City, you clashed with a red-haired interstellar pirate leader and a mysterious black-haired man. Your frequent activities exposed you to the undercurrents, and multiple factions, engaged in overt and covert struggles, reached out to you. Some wanted to extinguish you, others sought to claim you for themselves, and some even hailed you as the dawn of a new world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With your mother's mysterious death, your father's demise in the stars, and your friends being innocently affected, who should you align with next, and where should you head?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550670/extras/7a370dbb6e28a2dbf224516c6cbf7adf.avif?t=1741662122\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
